<ul>
<li>March 5th, 2024</li>
<li>Improvement: clean up MPDF temp directory after pdf generation</li>
<li>Improvement: set aria label on x close button from banner</li>
<li>Fix: deleting cookies with disallowed cookie names causing fatal error, props @baffled</li>
<li>Fix: missing cmplz_deny_all() function for expired cookies with a changed cookie policy id.</li>
