<li>Improvement: prefix &#8216;request&#8217; to prevent conflicts with weglot</li>
<li>Fix: bug in Divi Recaptcha integration</li>
<li>Fix: Block Editor dropping styles when in unsynced mode</li>
<li>Fix: Consent Mode moved to banner_loaded hook to ensure loading</li>
</ul>
<h4>6.5.3</h4>
<ul>
<li>08-08-2023</li>
