</ul>
<h4>6.5.1</h4>
<ul>
<li>10-07-2023</li>
<li>Improvement: restore php 7.2 support in burst installer</li>
<li>Improvement: catch server configurations not supporting webp</li>
<li>Improvement: catch not existing file when generating webp</li>
<li>Improvement: catch not existing $slug property in auto updates check</li>
