<li>Improvement: allow custom directory for cookie banner css generation</li>
<li>Improvement: catch open basedir restriction</li>
<li>Improvement: catch not existing accept button during initial cookie scan (no banner active yet)</li>
<li>Improvement: function cmplz_has_consent() in &#8216;other&#8217; region returned false when no cookies present, while it should return true in that case.</li>
