<li>New: Microsoft Ads/Microsoft Clarity integration</li>
<li>Fix: some scripts not executing properly because of copying data-service &amp; data-category attributes props @sophiaknows, @hamil1</li>
<li>Fix: new added query added to cookie block exclude to ensure Avada live builder works, props @franck_b, @markusand</li>
</ul>
